WEBVTT

00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:03.590
Okay, this next event is the last one.

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:07.020
<b>Field Day
Events</b>

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:07.020
<b>Three-Legged
Race</b>

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:07.020
<b>Scavenger
Hunt</b>

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:07.020
<b>Ball
Toss</b>

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:07.020
<b>Tug-of-War</b>

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:07.020
<b>Cheering</b>

00:00:04.650 --> 00:00:07.510
Who wants to be in the mixed relay?

00:00:10.690 --> 00:00:12.530
Er...

00:00:13.150 --> 00:00:15.990
Me! I'll do it!

00:00:18.030 --> 00:00:19.660
<b>Suzumi</b>

00:00:18.430 --> 00:00:19.660
Who else?

00:00:23.560 --> 00:00:25.980
Anyone?

00:00:32.130 --> 00:00:35.550
<i>Huh? How come no one wants to do it?</i>

00:00:35.550 --> 00:00:39.290
<i>I think the relay's the most fun event!</i>

00:00:39.290 --> 00:00:41.600
The relay's impossible.

00:00:41.600 --> 00:00:45.350
Yeah, we'd never win no 
matter how hard we tried.

00:00:49.370 --> 00:00:52.030
I'll decide, then.

00:00:52.780 --> 00:00:55.450
If I leave it to you guys, 
this'll drag on forever.

00:00:55.450 --> 00:00:55.820
Huh?

00:00:55.820 --> 00:00:57.070
Huh?!

00:00:57.070 --> 00:00:59.580
<b>Mixed
 Relay</b>

00:00:57.070 --> 00:00:59.580
<b>Suzumi</b>

00:00:57.070 --> 00:00:59.580
<b>Hirano</b>

00:00:57.070 --> 00:00:59.580
<b>Someya</b>

00:00:57.070 --> 00:00:59.580
<b>Shibasaki</b>

00:00:57.070 --> 00:00:59.580
Aizo-kun and Yujiro-kun?!

00:00:59.580 --> 00:01:01.210
What's with that team-up?!

00:01:01.210 --> 00:01:02.240
No fair!

00:01:02.240 --> 00:01:04.580
I'd have done the relay if I'd known!

00:01:04.910 --> 00:01:09.050
Okay, Suzumi-san, give me a 
clean copy of the list later.

00:01:09.050 --> 00:01:10.550
Right, yes.

00:01:15.330 --> 00:01:19.970
<i>They are </i>super<i> grumpy about this!</i>

00:01:19.970 --> 00:01:23.500
<i>I'm charmed by how you go all-out</i>

00:01:23.500 --> 00:01:27.980
<i>I'm charmed by your supportive smile</i>

00:01:27.980 --> 00:01:32.360
<i>"I must kiss you," says your Romeo</i>

00:01:32.360 --> 00:01:36.320
<i>Glad that you exist and that he met you</i>

00:01:44.200 --> 00:01:47.960
<i>I need more love, want to see you again soon</i>

00:01:47.960 --> 00:01:52.040
<i>Lock eyes with you and tell you</i>

00:01:52.040 --> 00:01:55.970
<i>My sincerest "Thank you for everything"</i>

00:01:55.970 --> 00:02:00.220
<i>Will you love me—
not as a fan, but for real?</i>

00:02:00.220 --> 00:02:03.250
<i>"Pick me"</i>

00:02:03.960 --> 00:02:06.980
<i>"No, pick me"</i>

00:02:07.900 --> 00:02:11.860
<i>Choose which kiss you want</i>

00:02:11.860 --> 00:02:15.030
<i>And let your Romeo bind you</i>

00:02:16.240 --> 00:02:19.470
<i>I'm charmed by how you go all-out</i>

00:02:19.470 --> 00:02:24.030
<i>I'm charmed watching you sing with me</i>

00:02:24.030 --> 00:02:27.370
<i>I'm even charmed by your tears</i>

00:02:27.370 --> 00:02:31.740
<i>I'm charmed by your supportive smile</i>

00:02:31.740 --> 00:02:35.380
<i>Thank you for coming to meet me</i>

00:02:35.380 --> 00:02:39.660
<i>Thank you for calling my name</i>

00:02:39.660 --> 00:02:44.220
<i>"I must kiss you," says your Romeo</i>

00:02:44.220 --> 00:02:48.400
<i>Glad that you exist and that he met you</i>

00:02:51.260 --> 00:02:54.520
LIP×LIP Radio presents: "Welcome, Julieta"!

00:02:54.850 --> 00:02:56.820
Hello, I'm Aizo.

00:02:56.820 --> 00:02:58.190
And I'm Yujiro.

00:02:58.190 --> 00:02:59.690
We're LIP×LIP!

00:03:00.900 --> 00:03:05.160
We recently went to a Full Throttle4 concert.

00:03:05.380 --> 00:03:11.320
They announced that they'd be appearing 
on "Best Artist Countdown Live."

00:03:11.320 --> 00:03:12.670
Amazing, right?

00:03:12.670 --> 00:03:15.740
Not to mention they'll also 
be emceeing the event.

00:03:15.740 --> 00:03:19.900
Tying together the big stars from 
every genre... It's unbelievable.

00:03:20.350 --> 00:03:23.180
That's our senpai for you, right?

00:03:23.180 --> 00:03:26.820
But we can't just sit around being astounded.

00:03:26.820 --> 00:03:27.430
Agreed.

00:03:28.130 --> 00:03:30.410
Full Throttle4 are veterans we respect,

00:03:30.410 --> 00:03:33.610
but they also represent a goal 
for us, so we have to keep up.

00:03:34.140 --> 00:03:36.320
There are still Countdown slots left.

00:03:36.900 --> 00:03:39.570
Let's do our best to win one!

00:03:40.680 --> 00:03:44.820
Yeah. Please cheer us on, everyone!

00:03:44.820 --> 00:03:48.130
All right, let's dive into 
the listener mail segment!

00:03:48.130 --> 00:03:51.830
Once again, we've got a lot of 
love letters from our Julietas.

00:03:52.120 --> 00:03:54.790
This is from a Julieta called "Melancholy Cat."

00:03:55.340 --> 00:03:57.820
"Aizo, Yujiro, I love you!"

00:03:57.820 --> 00:03:58.900
Me, too!

00:03:59.800 --> 00:04:02.270
"My high school Field Day is coming up.

00:04:02.270 --> 00:04:07.140
I suck at athletic stuff, so I'm 
pretty melancholy. What should I do?"

00:04:07.520 --> 00:04:11.390
Ah, Field Day! Our school's 
is coming up soon too, huh?

00:04:11.390 --> 00:04:16.330
Yep. Our class just decided everyone's 
events today in homeroom.

00:04:16.330 --> 00:04:18.820
We're going to be in the relay together.

00:04:19.950 --> 00:04:20.820
I'm pumped!

00:04:20.820 --> 00:04:23.820
Aizo, you're lucky because you're athletic.

00:04:24.160 --> 00:04:27.270
But I understand how Melancholy Cat feels.

00:04:27.580 --> 00:04:29.830
I'm not much of an athlete.

00:04:29.830 --> 00:04:32.490
But you're working hard, Yujiro!

00:04:32.490 --> 00:04:35.830
You always stick it out during dance lessons.

00:04:35.830 --> 00:04:38.800
Sure, because I don't want you to beat me,

00:04:38.800 --> 00:04:41.650
and I want to enjoy our 
concerts with our Julietas.

00:04:41.650 --> 00:04:43.330
Isn't that how these things work?

00:04:43.330 --> 00:04:44.010
Hmm?

00:04:44.010 --> 00:04:45.970
I've got weak points, too,

00:04:46.330 --> 00:04:49.220
but I think it's important to do 
my best so that I can enjoy myself.

00:04:49.220 --> 00:04:50.860
Good point.

00:04:50.860 --> 00:04:53.270
Plus, Melancholy Cat...

00:04:54.090 --> 00:04:55.480
You're not alone.

00:04:56.360 --> 00:04:59.110
We're cheering you on, so do your best.

00:04:59.730 --> 00:05:03.240
For doing your best, we give 
you a cheer and a kiss.

00:05:06.050 --> 00:05:07.280
For real, though...

00:05:08.450 --> 00:05:11.530
Didn't you say we wouldn't 
be doing Field Day?!

00:05:11.530 --> 00:05:13.860
I thought we'd be working.

00:05:13.860 --> 00:05:15.820
Don't be silly, you two.

00:05:15.820 --> 00:05:19.290
I opened up that day in your schedule.

00:05:19.290 --> 00:05:20.820
Seriously?

00:05:20.820 --> 00:05:22.310
I wanna skip.

00:05:22.310 --> 00:05:23.710
Ya just said on the radio

00:05:23.710 --> 00:05:27.130
that it's important to do your 
best so you can enjoy yourselves.

00:05:27.460 --> 00:05:29.260
Did we?

00:05:29.260 --> 00:05:31.390
I have no memory of that.

00:05:31.390 --> 00:05:33.050
You're scum.

00:05:34.220 --> 00:05:39.170
You're only young once, 
and for you, that time is now!

00:05:39.480 --> 00:05:41.460
Savor it as much as you can.

00:05:41.460 --> 00:05:43.070
What does that mean?

00:05:45.330 --> 00:05:47.110
Why're ya so against it?

00:05:47.110 --> 00:05:48.490
It's a waste of time.

00:05:48.490 --> 00:05:50.570
It's not useful for anything.

00:05:50.570 --> 00:05:53.430
What? But Field Day is fun!

00:05:53.430 --> 00:05:56.250
You're on the committee, 
too, aren't you, Hiyoko?

00:05:56.250 --> 00:05:57.290
Yes!

00:05:57.290 --> 00:05:58.840
Unbelievable.

00:05:58.840 --> 00:06:02.100
I'm surprised you signed 
up for such a hassle.

00:06:02.520 --> 00:06:06.390
We should enjoy everything 
high school life has to offer!

00:06:06.390 --> 00:06:11.350
Sure, assignin' the events 
was kinda tough, but...

00:06:12.780 --> 00:06:14.850
Field Days are fun!

00:06:14.850 --> 00:06:16.610
What was that pause about?

00:06:16.610 --> 00:06:17.610
Imagery!

00:06:17.610 --> 00:06:18.350
Huh?

00:06:18.580 --> 00:06:21.290
I tried doin' a Field Day in my mind!

00:06:21.290 --> 00:06:23.980
It was crazy exciting!

00:06:25.140 --> 00:06:27.740
Hey, wanna practice sometime?

00:06:30.280 --> 00:06:34.680
I mean practice passin' the baton. 
A bad pass makes things go wrong.

00:06:36.140 --> 00:06:39.190
Stop making everything about Field Day.

00:06:39.190 --> 00:06:40.670
Jocks are scary.

00:06:41.870 --> 00:06:43.670
Let's least do imagery trainin' to—

00:06:43.670 --> 00:06:44.850
Nope.

00:06:44.850 --> 00:06:46.450
What?!

00:06:46.920 --> 00:06:49.930
<b>Field Day</b>

00:06:51.130 --> 00:06:54.250
All right, everyone start your tasks.

00:06:54.630 --> 00:06:56.830
Let's all work together today!

00:06:56.830 --> 00:06:58.180
Yes, sir!

00:07:00.150 --> 00:07:01.550
Excuse me.

00:07:01.950 --> 00:07:02.810
Yes?

00:07:02.810 --> 00:07:12.700
<b>Newspaper Club</b>

00:07:03.080 --> 00:07:05.700
I'm Yamamoto Kodai, from the newspaper club.

00:07:06.040 --> 00:07:08.960
May I stand in front of the 
cheering competition before lunch

00:07:08.960 --> 00:07:11.530
to take a photo?

00:07:11.530 --> 00:07:12.700
Oh, sure!

00:07:13.320 --> 00:07:16.450
We'll move the cones aside for your photo.

00:07:16.680 --> 00:07:17.890
Thank you.

00:07:18.330 --> 00:07:20.460
Isn't Field Day fun?

00:07:22.600 --> 00:07:23.770
It is.

00:07:28.280 --> 00:07:31.340
Good, those smiles mean they're still okay.

00:07:31.340 --> 00:07:34.190
You two will be in the relay, 
right? I'll cheer you on!

00:07:34.190 --> 00:07:34.880
Me, too!

00:07:34.880 --> 00:07:35.750
Thank you.

00:07:35.750 --> 00:07:38.190
Yujiro-kun, want to have lunch together?

00:07:38.190 --> 00:07:39.050
Me, too!

00:07:39.050 --> 00:07:43.850
Oh, Aizo and I were thinking of doing our 
last relay meeting during lunch, so...

00:07:44.540 --> 00:07:47.610
<i>Ah, things may be getting dicey.</i>

00:07:47.610 --> 00:07:50.430
Shibasaki-kun, Someya-kun!

00:07:51.100 --> 00:07:52.870
Um...

00:07:52.870 --> 00:07:57.200
Oh! I put out headbands 
for you, so go check, okay?

00:07:58.810 --> 00:08:00.170
Got it!

00:08:00.170 --> 00:08:02.460
Sorry, we have to go back to our seats.

00:08:02.970 --> 00:08:04.040
Okay!

00:08:04.040 --> 00:08:04.840
See ya!

00:08:04.400 --> 00:08:05.410
Good luck!

00:08:05.080 --> 00:08:05.970
Bye!

00:08:06.560 --> 00:08:07.790
Good luck!

00:08:16.290 --> 00:08:17.170
Where are they?

00:08:19.980 --> 00:08:20.820
Hey.

00:08:21.390 --> 00:08:23.480
Have you seen our headbands?

00:08:23.480 --> 00:08:24.330
Huh?

00:08:24.980 --> 00:08:28.480
Suzumi-san said she'd leave them out for us.

00:08:28.480 --> 00:08:31.230
I'm pretty sure Hiyori has the headbands.

00:08:32.490 --> 00:08:33.920
Want me to go ask her?

00:08:35.610 --> 00:08:38.890
She looks busy. Now's probably not the time.

00:08:38.890 --> 00:08:40.390
Agreed.

00:08:40.390 --> 00:08:43.330
Does the Field Day committee 
have that much work?

00:08:43.330 --> 00:08:45.620
It's not just that.

00:08:45.620 --> 00:08:50.500
After we assigned the events, a few 
girls said they wouldn't do theirs.

00:08:51.450 --> 00:08:54.510
Suddenly they were all like, 
"I wanted to do the relay."

00:08:54.510 --> 00:08:59.050
So Hiyori ended up filling 
in for <i>all</i> of them. Right?

00:08:59.050 --> 00:09:00.170
Mm-hmm.

00:09:00.170 --> 00:09:04.770
We offered to do some, 
but she turned us down.

00:09:05.230 --> 00:09:07.520
What? That's crazy...

00:09:07.520 --> 00:09:09.250
Isn't Field Day fun?

00:09:09.250 --> 00:09:11.020
You're sure in high spirits, Hiyori-chan.

00:09:12.680 --> 00:09:14.500
She looks genuinely happy.

00:09:14.500 --> 00:09:16.530
I know, right?

00:09:16.530 --> 00:09:19.530
I'm lucky I get to be in so many events!

00:09:19.530 --> 00:09:21.260
She really said that!

00:09:26.550 --> 00:09:31.670
All three-legged race participants, 
please gather on the field.

00:09:34.420 --> 00:09:37.930
Come on, Kotaro, scoot your leg closer.

00:09:37.930 --> 00:09:39.650
R-Right.

00:09:42.550 --> 00:09:44.980
Okay, got it tied!

00:09:45.940 --> 00:09:47.560
Y-You're so clo—

00:09:47.560 --> 00:09:48.810
Sorry!

00:09:55.480 --> 00:09:58.350
Setoguchi-senpai! Enomoto-senpai!

00:09:58.820 --> 00:10:01.330
Next! It's time to start!

00:10:12.200 --> 00:10:13.840
On our way!

00:10:14.550 --> 00:10:15.840
On your marks.

00:10:18.690 --> 00:10:21.070
Hey, don't grab me so close.

00:10:21.070 --> 00:10:23.660
Excuse me? You're unbelievable.

00:10:23.660 --> 00:10:24.720
Get set!

00:10:34.420 --> 00:10:37.090
Awesome! They're in perfect sync!

00:10:35.900 --> 00:10:38.940
One, two! One, two! One, two! One, two!

00:10:38.940 --> 00:10:41.930
One, two! One, two! One, two! One, two!

00:10:41.930 --> 00:10:44.740
One, two! One, two! One, two! One, two!

00:10:44.740 --> 00:10:48.290
One, two! One, two! One, two! One, two!

00:10:46.290 --> 00:10:48.290
Go!

00:10:50.790 --> 00:10:52.110
Yes!

00:10:52.110 --> 00:10:53.300
We did it!

00:10:56.460 --> 00:10:58.550
Kotaro looks happy.

00:10:58.550 --> 00:11:00.620
Time to do my thing.

00:11:04.300 --> 00:11:07.030
On your marks! Get set!

00:11:20.020 --> 00:11:21.070
Arisa-chan!

00:11:24.070 --> 00:11:25.080
Run!

00:11:25.080 --> 00:11:26.080
What?

00:11:26.370 --> 00:11:27.820
Hey!

00:11:29.750 --> 00:11:32.670
Yay! First place!

00:11:33.970 --> 00:11:35.650
What was that about?

00:11:35.650 --> 00:11:37.800
I just followed the instructions.

00:11:38.590 --> 00:11:40.840
<b>Something Cute</b>

00:11:41.630 --> 00:11:44.140
My paper said to bring "something cute."

00:11:42.590 --> 00:11:45.100
<b>Something Cute</b>

00:11:46.690 --> 00:11:47.600
I...

00:11:47.600 --> 00:11:50.630
I'm not a <i>thing</i>!

00:12:04.870 --> 00:12:06.620
Hurray!

00:12:06.620 --> 00:12:08.540
Hurray!

00:12:08.540 --> 00:12:10.540
Green!

00:12:10.540 --> 00:12:12.570
Hurray, hurray, green!

00:12:12.570 --> 00:12:14.920
Hurray, hurray, green!

00:12:21.180 --> 00:12:24.890
Juri-chan's cheerin' uniform 
looks so good on her!

00:12:27.890 --> 00:12:31.520
Here ya go. Good work out there!

00:12:31.520 --> 00:12:33.100
Thanks.

00:12:33.100 --> 00:12:36.230
Your cheerin' was super cute!

00:12:36.230 --> 00:12:36.940
Right?

00:12:36.940 --> 00:12:37.900
Yeah.

00:12:38.220 --> 00:12:40.550
My boyfriend said that, too.

00:12:40.550 --> 00:12:43.850
Huh? Your boyfriend goes to our school?

00:12:43.850 --> 00:12:46.390
Yep! He's here.

00:12:46.950 --> 00:12:48.440
Suzumi-san, shouldn't you go?

00:12:48.440 --> 00:12:49.970
Oh, the relay!

00:12:49.970 --> 00:12:51.910
Okay, I'll be off.

00:12:51.910 --> 00:12:53.020
Good luck.

00:12:53.020 --> 00:12:54.030
Stay pumped!

00:12:54.030 --> 00:12:54.920
Yeah!

00:12:56.730 --> 00:12:58.690
You've got a big head on ya, huh?

00:12:59.290 --> 00:13:00.300
Hmm?

00:13:00.590 --> 00:13:02.360
Just 'cause you're an idol or whatever,

00:13:02.360 --> 00:13:06.090
you're always surrounded by girls, 
actin' all shallow and flirty—it pisses us off!

00:13:07.010 --> 00:13:09.070
<i>That's not a nice thing to say!</i>

00:13:09.070 --> 00:13:10.930
<i>Maybe those two seem shallow and flirty,</i>

00:13:10.930 --> 00:13:14.060
<i>but it's 'cause they're workin' 
their hardest as idols!</i>

00:13:14.060 --> 00:13:16.700
<i>How dare these guys badmouth 
them without knowin' anything?!</i>

00:13:16.700 --> 00:13:18.360
<i>I'm gonna tell them off!</i>

00:13:18.580 --> 00:13:25.480
<i>No, I can't! I'm the manager-in-training.
I can't start a fight!</i>

00:13:25.990 --> 00:13:26.870
<i>But...</i>

00:13:26.870 --> 00:13:29.650
Don't just stand there. Say something!

00:13:29.650 --> 00:13:33.580
<i>The mixed relay prelims are about to begin.</i>

00:13:33.580 --> 00:13:37.080
<i>Athletes, please gather in front of the tent.</i>

00:13:35.080 --> 00:13:36.670
Someya-kun!

00:13:37.610 --> 00:13:38.830
Suzumi...

00:13:38.830 --> 00:13:41.340
The relay is next! Let's go!

00:13:42.130 --> 00:13:44.450
What, you're gonna be in the relay, too?

00:13:45.250 --> 00:13:48.900
Huh. Well, you'll just lose in the prelims.

00:13:48.900 --> 00:13:50.350
Yep.

00:13:50.350 --> 00:13:53.470
Wish I could meet the 
great idols in the finals!

00:13:56.180 --> 00:13:58.340
Someya-kun, are ya okay?

00:13:58.890 --> 00:13:59.980
Perfectly fine.

00:13:59.980 --> 00:14:02.010
They were third-years, right?

00:14:02.010 --> 00:14:03.870
Upperclassmen or not,

00:14:03.870 --> 00:14:07.310
it's just rude to make fun of 
ya like idols are lowlifes!

00:14:07.310 --> 00:14:11.620
More like they're lowlife upperclassmen 
who can't do anything but envy us.

00:14:11.860 --> 00:14:12.460
Huh?

00:14:12.870 --> 00:14:17.370
They're blatantly jealous, and their only 
skill is attacking people in groups.

00:14:17.370 --> 00:14:19.370
I-I see...

00:14:19.370 --> 00:14:23.550
But good job controllin' your 
temper! Just let it roll off ya!

00:14:23.550 --> 00:14:26.040
Let them talk.

00:14:26.040 --> 00:14:28.090
You must be joking.

00:14:29.740 --> 00:14:33.020
You think I'll just grin and bear it? As if.

00:14:33.740 --> 00:14:35.270
I'll destroy them.

00:14:36.100 --> 00:14:37.310
I agree!

00:14:37.890 --> 00:14:43.020
You're right. We can't let this turn into 
a fight, but even idols get mad, right?

00:14:43.020 --> 00:14:44.900
I got mad, too.

00:14:45.260 --> 00:14:47.900
So let's win our way through the prelims!

00:14:48.240 --> 00:14:51.660
And then in the finals, 
let's crush 'em to powder!

00:14:52.410 --> 00:14:53.900
Okay.

00:14:55.450 --> 00:14:58.460
Hiyori was crazy fast in the prelims, huh?

00:14:58.460 --> 00:15:00.840
And the others worked hard, too.

00:15:00.840 --> 00:15:04.230
Someya was weirdly into it.

00:15:04.740 --> 00:15:06.340
Good luck in the finals, too!

00:15:06.580 --> 00:15:10.340
Yeah! I'll make sure I don't fall 
or let anyone else get ahead!

00:15:16.850 --> 00:15:19.740
Good, his team made it, too.

00:15:20.450 --> 00:15:22.070
Why are you so fired up?

00:15:22.390 --> 00:15:24.860
Don't you dare let up, Aizo.

00:15:24.860 --> 00:15:29.920
Say what? We got through the 
prelims. Haven't we done enough?

00:15:29.920 --> 00:15:31.730
Let's do the bare minimum and—

00:15:30.830 --> 00:15:32.860
Arisa-chan!

00:15:33.370 --> 00:15:39.370
I'll run my fastest in the finals,
 so cheer for me, okay?

00:15:41.370 --> 00:15:43.550
Your brother ran really fast.

00:15:44.050 --> 00:15:47.930
Setoguchi-senpai's form was 
<i>much</i> better, of course,

00:15:47.930 --> 00:15:49.930
but your brother was zoomin'!

00:15:49.930 --> 00:15:51.380
You know?

00:15:51.380 --> 00:15:52.250
Hmm?

00:15:52.660 --> 00:15:54.520
That he's my...

00:15:54.520 --> 00:15:57.780
Yeah. He's your big brother, right?

00:15:57.780 --> 00:16:00.770
I talked with him once!

00:16:01.850 --> 00:16:03.520
All right!

00:16:03.520 --> 00:16:07.520
Let's pulverize those uppity first-years.

00:16:12.360 --> 00:16:13.470
Suzumi...

00:16:14.100 --> 00:16:15.000
Yujiro...

00:16:15.860 --> 00:16:17.290
Don't slow me down.

00:16:19.090 --> 00:16:23.060
Run like it's the only thing you 
care about. We're taking first place.

00:16:23.620 --> 00:16:25.710
No matter what it takes...

00:16:26.090 --> 00:16:27.620
I'm gonna win!

00:16:27.620 --> 00:16:28.710
I'm gonna win!

00:16:31.930 --> 00:16:33.590
What's with them?

00:16:33.590 --> 00:16:35.720
Go all-out, Shibasaki!

00:16:35.720 --> 00:16:37.850
Our win is riding on you!

00:16:40.250 --> 00:16:41.420
On it!

00:16:45.160 --> 00:16:48.670
<i>Someya-kun and Shibasaki-kun 
are really motivated!</i>

00:16:49.720 --> 00:16:51.530
<i>I better work hard, too!</i>

00:16:52.530 --> 00:16:54.900
Let's win first place, yeah?!

00:16:54.900 --> 00:16:58.510
B-But I'm not as fast as you guys!

00:16:59.010 --> 00:16:59.750
Huh?

00:17:00.180 --> 00:17:01.000
Huh?

00:17:01.400 --> 00:17:02.750
Let's run till we drop.

00:17:03.160 --> 00:17:04.250
Okay?

00:17:04.250 --> 00:17:06.920
U-Um...

00:17:28.020 --> 00:17:29.080
You can do it!

00:17:29.080 --> 00:17:30.520
Just keep it up!

00:17:30.520 --> 00:17:33.030
Looking good! Go for it!

00:17:57.860 --> 00:18:00.130
Sorry, I caught up.

00:18:05.340 --> 00:18:06.230
Suzumi!

00:18:06.230 --> 00:18:07.490
Leave it to me!

00:18:13.480 --> 00:18:16.670
<i>Faster... Gotta be faster!</i>

00:18:17.710 --> 00:18:18.680
<i>Faster!</i>

00:18:26.680 --> 00:18:27.500
Bye.

00:18:28.360 --> 00:18:29.500
Shibasaki-kun!

00:18:30.250 --> 00:18:31.230
Here!

00:18:34.790 --> 00:18:35.380
Suzumi!

00:18:37.050 --> 00:18:37.840
Run!

00:18:47.270 --> 00:18:53.020
I'm not gonna lose to someone 
who's always chasing tail!

00:18:54.110 --> 00:18:57.030
There's only one girl 
for me now, so shove it!

00:18:59.770 --> 00:19:01.530
Go for it!

00:19:09.400 --> 00:19:11.290
Go for it!

00:19:13.560 --> 00:19:15.550
Go, Shibasaki-kun!

00:19:13.560 --> 00:19:15.550
Go, Aizo!

00:19:32.660 --> 00:19:34.690
You were great, Shibasaki!

00:19:33.230 --> 00:19:34.690
Nicely done!

00:19:34.690 --> 00:19:36.650
Shibasaki's the man!

00:19:35.870 --> 00:19:38.190
Hey, cut it out.

00:19:43.020 --> 00:19:45.200
That was fun!

00:20:03.260 --> 00:20:06.350
<i>Sh-Sh-Sh-Shoot!</i>

00:20:06.350 --> 00:20:08.260
<i>I got carried away by my excitement.</i>

00:20:08.950 --> 00:20:10.870
<i>N-N-N-Now what?!</i>

00:20:10.870 --> 00:20:16.360
<i>If the fangirls set their sights on me, 
my school life will be over!</i>

00:20:17.360 --> 00:20:19.170
Me, too!

00:20:19.170 --> 00:20:20.960
No fair!

00:20:20.960 --> 00:20:22.110
Me next!

00:20:21.340 --> 00:20:23.060
High five, please!

00:20:24.470 --> 00:20:26.120
Me, too! Me, too!

00:20:31.610 --> 00:20:32.960
Here you go.

00:20:33.320 --> 00:20:34.960
We lost, huh?

00:20:34.960 --> 00:20:37.750
Nah, Shibaken was the only loser.

00:20:38.070 --> 00:20:40.800
Wow, man, that's cold.

00:20:40.800 --> 00:20:43.050
The relay is a team race!

00:20:44.230 --> 00:20:45.030
I'm kidding.

00:20:45.030 --> 00:20:46.550
It was fun.

00:20:46.550 --> 00:20:50.090
I worked so hard! My feelings are hurt!

00:20:50.090 --> 00:20:52.060
Comfort me, Arisa-chan!

00:20:54.030 --> 00:20:55.180
You're ridiculous.

00:20:56.390 --> 00:20:58.690
That was crazy exciting, huh?

00:20:58.690 --> 00:20:59.430
Yeah!

00:20:59.430 --> 00:21:00.940
Can I have a moment?

00:21:00.940 --> 00:21:02.620
Oh, the news—

00:21:02.620 --> 00:21:03.910
Ko-chan!

00:21:03.910 --> 00:21:05.950
Hi! Here for the paper?

00:21:05.950 --> 00:21:06.980
Yep.

00:21:08.100 --> 00:21:10.330
Juri-chan, you know each other?

00:21:10.330 --> 00:21:12.450
More like we're dating.

00:21:12.450 --> 00:21:13.650
Huh?!

00:21:13.650 --> 00:21:17.630
Congratulations on your relay win.
 Can I get runner interviews?

00:21:17.630 --> 00:21:19.880
S-Sure, of course!

00:21:20.570 --> 00:21:22.710
I'm not sure about those two, though.

00:21:22.970 --> 00:21:24.490
It's fine with me.

00:21:26.610 --> 00:21:28.470
Just a few minutes, then.

00:21:29.390 --> 00:21:32.170
May I have your comments on the race?

00:21:33.720 --> 00:21:35.960
Well I guess I'd say...

00:21:37.430 --> 00:21:38.600
I had fun!

00:21:40.570 --> 00:21:45.110
Me, too. I had so, so much fun!

00:21:50.990 --> 00:21:55.560
<b>Episode 8</b>

00:21:50.990 --> 00:21:55.560
<b>Idols Run the Show!</b>

00:21:55.670 --> 00:21:56.160
"Romeo."

00:22:02.880 --> 00:22:06.310
<i>Pleased to meet you, fair lady,
I've come from a western land</i>

00:22:06.310 --> 00:22:09.750
<i>To meet you, to love you,
and to win your hand</i>

00:22:09.750 --> 00:22:13.210
<i>Don't be alarmed,
I know this is sudden</i>

00:22:13.210 --> 00:22:16.770
<i>Please be my princess,
and let me be your husband</i>

00:22:23.570 --> 00:22:26.930
<i>Ah, fair lady, do you
fret over what to do?</i>

00:22:26.930 --> 00:22:30.280
<i>I have a proposal, for
that frown doesn't suit you</i>

00:22:30.280 --> 00:22:33.710
<i>If it suits your fancy, then
please come away with me</i>

00:22:33.710 --> 00:22:37.290
<i>Let us leave it all behind,
and run away to the east</i>

00:22:37.290 --> 00:22:44.090
<i>Your rosy lips seem lonely,
that much I can tell</i>

00:22:44.090 --> 00:22:50.330
<i>Let me cast upon them
a tender spell</i>

00:22:50.330 --> 00:22:52.970
<i>And now, go put on a dress</i>

00:22:52.970 --> 00:22:57.770
<i>May I have this dance with
the world's best princess?</i>

00:22:57.770 --> 00:22:59.470
<i>Everyone wants you</i>

00:22:59.470 --> 00:23:01.210
<i>And that drives us wild</i>

00:23:01.210 --> 00:23:04.100
<i>I'm going to steal true love's kiss</i>

00:23:04.100 --> 00:23:11.450
<i>I have a gift, so close your eyes
as I pluck us a star right out of the sky</i>

00:23:11.450 --> 00:23:13.270
<i>All the world wants you</i>

00:23:13.270 --> 00:23:14.910
<i>It makes us play to win</i>

00:23:14.910 --> 00:23:17.870
<i>Your name is "Julieta"</i>

00:23:26.340 --> 00:23:33.010
Next time, on episode 9 of 
<i>Heroines Run the Show</i>...

00:23:33.010 --> 00:23:34.100
"Scandal"!

00:23:34.100 --> 00:23:40.250
<b>Episode 9
Scandal</b>
